<%--
Slot_Inheritance_Errors_Surface - a broken slot-only template inheritance is an ERROR.

Audit bug 20: both failure modes of the slot-only branch in component.ts _render() were
swallowed into `instructions = []` plus a console.warn, so the component rendered as an
empty div and the real defect (a throwing parent template, or a parent template that was
never registered) was invisible.

Both children below are declared IN THIS TEMPLATE on purpose: if a failing child wedged
its parent, this component would never reach on_ready() and the run would produce no
SUMMARY at all.
--%>
<Define:Slot_Inheritance_Errors_Surface>
  <div>
    <h1>Slot-only inheritance failures surface as errors</h1>
    <Sie_Child $sid="child" />
    <Sie_Orphan $sid="orphan" />
  </div>
</Define:Slot_Inheritance_Errors_Surface>
